10	## Blocking the Executor
11	
12	The #1 mistake in async Rust: running blocking code on the async executor thread. This starves other tasks.
13	
14	```rust
15	// ❌ WRONG: Blocks the entire executor thread
16	async fn bad_handler() -> String {
17	    let data = std::fs::read_to_string("big_file.txt").unwrap(); // BLOCKS!
18	    process(&data)
19	}
