# 13. Production Patterns 🔴

> **What you'll learn:**
> - Graceful shutdown with `watch` channels and `select!`
> - Backpressure: bounded channels prevent OOM
> - Structured concurrency: `JoinSet` and `TaskTracker`
> - Timeouts, retries, and exponential backoff
